  <h2 id="articleship-life">Articleship life: stipend, hours, and what actually happens</h2>

  <p>
    Articleship is the 2-year mandatory practical training period, and it is where most "is CA worth it"
    doubts actually get tested against reality, not theory.
  </p>

  <h3>The stipend, by city size</h3>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
      <thead>
